fix-forward #3033: restore JSON/XML text classification in detect_kind

The PR dropped application/json, application/xml, text/xml from _MIME_KIND_MAP
and .json/.xml from _EXT_OVERRIDE_MAP, relying on mimetypes.guess_type + a
text/* rule. But mimetypes returns application/json and application/xml for
those extensions -- neither starts with text/ -- so JSON and XML uploads
classified as file with no text extraction.

Fix: put application/json, application/xml, text/xml back in _MIME_KIND_MAP
-> text, and add .json/.xml to _EXT_OVERRIDE_MAP so the answer does not
depend on the host mime.types database. Leave the text/* rule in place.

